server/admin_config.json
admin_config.json
!**/server/admin_config.example.json
!server/admin_config.example.json

**/server/sensor_data.json
server/sensor_data.json
sensor_data.json
!**/server/sensor_data.example.json
!server/sensor_data.example.json

